  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Triple nexus project Ethiopia-Kenya (ASE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The nexus project is a innovative program that helps to integrate humanitarian, development and peacebuilding aspects. Currently the project locations in northern part of Kenya and Ethiopia it is a cross border project. The project will be implemented by different partners (PACIDA, ASE&amp;CIFA). The partner PACIDA will be engaged in cross border interventions or activities and CIFA will implement in Kenya and ASE will implement the national level interventions&apos; project will have good reputation and will be scale up.</narrative>
  </description>
